      "id": "SwitchSoftware.Repositories.EntityFramework.MySql",
      "range": "[9.0.0, )"
    },
    "message": "Version 10.0.0 was published targeting EF Core 10 using Oracle's MySql.EntityFrameworkCore connector as a transitional measure. This version is not aligned with the project roadmap and should not be used. The intended MySQL provider for this package is always Pomelo, not Oracle's connector.\nProjects targeting net10.0 should use version 9.0.0 of this package. Pomelo officially supports running its 9.x releases on .NET 10 — the TargetFramework of your project and the version of EF Core/Pomelo are independent concerns. There is no functional or compatibility issue with using EF Core 9 + Pomelo 9 in a net10.0 project.",
    "reasons": [
      "Other"
    ]
  },
